],"a",{"href":292,"rel":293},"https:\u002F\u002Fbun.sh",[294],"nofollow",[282,296,297,300],{},[285,298,299],{},"A Kinotic organization"," you are a member of, with a linked GitHub organization",[274,302,304],{"id":303},"create-your-application","Create Your Application",[270,306,307],{},"Kinotic OS creates your Application and Project and provisions a GitHub repository for it, already scaffolded as a Bun workspace with the Kinotic CLI vendored as a dev dependency -- there is nothing to install globally.",[270,309,310],{},"The fastest way is the official Kinotic plugin, which drives the whole flow conversationally. In Claude Code:",[312,313,318],"pre",{"className":314,"code":316,"language":317},[315],"language-text","\u002Fplugin marketplace add kinotic-ai\u002Fagent-plugin\n\u002Fplugin install kinotic@kinotic\n\u002Fkinotic:new-app my-app\n","text",[319,320,316],"code",{"__ignoreMap":321},"",[270,323,324],{},"In Codex (the CLI, the IDE extension, or the ChatGPT desktop app), install the same plugin and ask Codex to create a Kinotic app:",[312,326,330],{"className":327,"code":328,"language":329,"meta":321,"style":321},"language-bash shiki shiki-themes material-theme-lighter material-theme material-theme-palenight","codex plugin marketplace add kinotic-ai\u002Fagent-plugin\ncodex plugin add kinotic@kinotic\n","bash",[319,331,332,354],{"__ignoreMap":321},[333,334,337,341,345,348,351],"span",{"class":335,"line":336},"line",1,[333,338,340],{"class":339},"sBMFI","codex",[333,342,344],{"class":343},"sfazB"," plugin",[333,346,347],{"class":343}," marketplace",[333,349,350],{"class":343}," add",[333,352,353],{"class":343}," kinotic-ai\u002Fagent-plugin\n",[333,355,357,359,361,363],{"class":335,"line":356},2,[333,358,340],{"class":339},[333,360,344],{"class":343},[333,362,350],{"class":343},[333,364,365],{"class":343}," kinotic@kinotic\n",[270,367,368,369,372],{},"In Grok Build, install it and run ",[319,370,371],{},"\u002Fnew-app my-app",":",[312,374,376],{"className":327,"